{"parse": {"title": "11TH-16", "pageid": 110485, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-15\" title=\"11TH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-16</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-17\" title=\"11TH-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">16</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.AA.E5.AE.8C.E6.88.90.E7.9A.84.E5.B8.83.E9.81.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"未完成的布道\">未完成的布道</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 未完成的布道</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Unfulfilled Prophecy</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>仍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>哭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泣<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11116</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自从停火的消息传到教堂，拉蒂斯就一直缄口不语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他长久地跪在祭坛前，已经有好几日没有吃正餐，原本已足够瘦削的他此刻似乎已经变成了一座嶙峋的塔楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>玛丽，这可如何是好？他连我亲手给他做的饼干都不吃了，他以前可不是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人担忧地将手怀抱在胸前，对此现状无可奈何。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……拉蒂斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她发出试探性的呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>战争没有以他所预言的方式结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>他要从错误地解读了预兆的罪恶感中走出来，这需要一些时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>拉蒂斯，主会包容我们的愚昧和罪恶，只要你的心是向着主的……唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好心而虔诚的女人止住自己说更多话的欲望，她知道自己绝无可能通过宗教论理说服比自己学识更加渊博的拉蒂斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>玛丽，无论他是怎么想的，再过几天，我们一定要一起回鲁昂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人珊珊离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜来到拉蒂斯身边，但无心打扰拉蒂斯的默祷。<br />她转向一直坐在角落中掩面哭泣的少女雕塑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>拉蒂斯，你告诉过我，在战争结束的时候，艾格尼丝会恢复原样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿出一块手帕，在“雕塑”上轻轻擦拭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>可是现在呢？我们还有什么办法带回共同的朋友……和亲人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>………………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回应她的仍然只有谦卑与愧疚的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……玛丽？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>转过头，玛丽安娜看见教堂这几日的常客。与往常一样，她照例带来了不少食物——这次是一些腊肠与干奶酪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱将补给品交给其他人后，径直朝玛丽安娜走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>前线有什么新消息？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>一部分军队已经撤离前线，还有一部分会在停火协定正式签订之后撤退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>拉蒂斯……他还是不吃东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>不用管他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她已经不打算在这件事上纠缠，她继续刚才的工作——为掩面哭泣的少女雕塑擦去灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>其实……我不知道这么问是否礼貌——这是一个……真正的雕塑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>真正的雕塑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我、我不知道该怎么说……只是，我从来没见她活动过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我明白你的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她收起手帕，深吸一口气，湿冷的晨雾灌入肺腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>她是艾格尼丝，我的远房表妹，我们有同一个曾祖母。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把手放在艾格尼丝石质的膝盖上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_zhuangyuan\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_zhuangyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhuangyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>1914年之前，我们一直生活在一起。有时在鲁昂郊区的家族庄园里，有时她会来巴黎的出租屋看望我。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_fating2\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_fating2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_fating2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>战争开始之后不久，我加入军队离开家乡。在第一次回到家时，我发现她化成了一座雕塑。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>她……一直如此？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你必须要让你的心脏保持跳动……如果你从内到外都成为了石头，就无法凭自己的力量恢复肉身了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>但拉蒂斯告诉我另外的可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>按照拉蒂斯的说法，艾格尼丝的石化并非出于平凡的理由，而是她选择了一条自我牺牲的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>同时这也是一份预言——石像鬼应该在这场战争中置身事外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>也许战争结束的那一天，会有奇迹降临在艾格尼丝身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看向跪在地上的拉蒂斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>现在看来，他的预言是错的。艾格尼丝还是没能复原。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>那有没有什么别的办法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的石像鬼懊丧地摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我也不清楚让艾格尼丝复原的方法……我对血脉的了解甚至不比一个外人多多少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我的大多数同族都会在成年前接受族内的传统教育，但祖母支持我在很小的时候就去世俗学校读书的愿望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>直到战争爆发前，我都住在巴黎租的小房间里，准备申请巴黎装饰艺术学院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜勉强自己看向玛尔纱的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>之后就是战争……战争，你也清楚。过去的记忆，还有许多生命，随着炮火声一起消失。我失去了很多朋友和亲人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>玛丽……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>算了。你有时间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你想做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……出去走走。我在教堂待太久了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>历经跋涉，她们回到了那一片曾被杀戮所扰的原野。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>飞行员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>路途中谈及的话题仍在继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——是的，我曾经想过要当飞行员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>当时有很多骑兵都加入了空军，他们认为，只有天上还保留有最后一丝骑士精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>至于地面的部队，唯一能做的就是在泥泞中爬行，或者挖战壕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我不喜欢飞机。在地面的人拿它们没有任何办法，还有那些该死的引擎声……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咽下更多的抱怨，以免显得太过难堪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士轻轻拍了拍石像鬼的后背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你不需要再担心了，也许……你会喜欢上坐飞机旅行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把目光转向如浪涌般的草地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你看见那些人的尸体了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-526501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>没有，也许卡戎已经收走了他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>哈……有可能。他倒确实是个有意思的怪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>还是个好人——在公墓的时候，我们差点又要打起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我想起来了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然低下身子，在路边摸索着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526516.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-526516.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526516.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526516.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-526516.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526516.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-526516.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526516.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你用烟雾弹呛过我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-312613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-312613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-312613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>哈哈哈——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士笑着在土路上奔跑，石像鬼一边大步追赶，一边用雨披擦去脸上的土灰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——她们停在风车前，巨大的齿轮系统啮合转动，仿佛一位年迈巨人的呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的一切沉静在奇异的宁静中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你是不是该走了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>不，今天我有很多空闲的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我是说之后……我知道在和约签订之前，基金会需要你留在这里看住我的动向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>也不完全是这样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>没事。你留下吧。只要你不对我撒谎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你有需要的地方，我可以帮忙，但不要劝我加入基金会。我不能丢下我的家人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我知道……正式停火之后，我也要离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>有人在风车里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——我听着更像是马的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>马……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二人取下武器，小心翼翼地向风车的入口接近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜靠在玛尔纱之前，让一边的身体石化，侧着身子打开风车的塔门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">战马：</div><div>咴咴——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>哇——好漂亮的小马！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这真是……一匹马？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-16"}}